# Core portfolio rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.agents/project-context.md` before changes; then use the matching `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` workflow.
- Never invent public claims. CV Markdown and curated career profiles are authoritative for public facts.
- Preserve EN/PT-BR parity and the current `setLang()` pattern for visitor-facing copy.
- Keep the site static and dependency-free unless the owner approves a stack change.
- Preserve public links, anchors, downloads, and external-link security attributes.
- Never commit or deploy without explicit owner approval.
- Treat the current dashboard implementation and `assets/css/tokens.css` as the active visual baseline. The former Sauce Labs design specification is retired.
